0 FILE 10025 - main.ldr
0 Santa Fe Super Chief Mail Car (set 10025-1) — a light grey and dark grey mail train car with grilled side panels, glazed end windows, four opening side doors with glass, a curved-arch roof, an interior with red minifig seats, a brown spindled fence and yellow cups, SANTA FE lettering and 1928 number stickers, and two single-axle wheel bogies with magnetic couplings
